{
  "id": "concentration_of_carbon_dioxide_in_the_atmosphere",
  "title": "Concentration of Carbon Dioxide in the Atmosphere",
  "description": "The atmospheric Carbon Dioxide concentration year 1959 - 2015.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Concentration of Carbon Dioxide in the Atmosphere\n\nThis tool analyzes the atmospheric CO₂ concentration data spanning from 1959 to 2015.\n\n**Data Overview:**\n- Time Period: 1959-2015\n- Measurement: Atmospheric CO₂ concentration\n- Units: Parts Per Million (ppm)\n\n**Key Information:**\nCarbon dioxide (CO₂) is a greenhouse gas that plays a crucial role in climate regulation. This dataset tracks the concentration levels over more than 50 years, showing trends in atmospheric composition."
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Year",
        "CO₂ Concentration (ppm)",
        "Annual Change (ppm)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          1959,
          315.98,
          "-"
        ],
        [
          1969,
          326.16,
          1.02
        ],
        [
          1979,
          336.84,
          1.07
        ],
        [
          1989,
          353.12,
          1.63
        ],
        [
          1999,
          368.38,
          1.53
        ],
        [
          2005,
          379.8,
          1.88
        ],
        [
          2015,
          400.83,
          2.1
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "start_year",
          "label": "Start Year",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1959,
          "unit": "year"
        },
        {
          "id": "end_year",
          "label": "End Year",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 2015,
          "unit": "year"
        },
        {
          "id": "start_concentration",
          "label": "Starting CO₂ Concentration",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 315.98,
          "unit": "ppm"
        },
        {
          "id": "end_concentration",
          "label": "Ending CO₂ Concentration",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 400.83,
          "unit": "ppm"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_increase",
          "label": "Total CO₂ Increase",
          "formula": "inputs.end_concentration - inputs.start_concentration",
          "unit": "ppm",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "time_period",
          "label": "Time Period",
          "formula": "inputs.end_year - inputs.start_year",
          "unit": "years",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "average_annual_increase",
          "label": "Average Annual Increase",
          "formula": "(inputs.end_concentration - inputs.start_concentration) / (inputs.end_year - inputs.start_year)",
          "unit": "ppm/year",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "percentage_increase",
          "label": "Percentage Increase",
          "formula": "((inputs.end_concentration - inputs.start_concentration) / inputs.start_concentration) * 100",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}